// Sets mask for log messages that are logged (either via `os_log` or the user specified callback) - `context`: context to set callbacks for - `log_level_mask`: bitmask of levels to log for (Default is BNNSGraphMessageLevelUnsupported | BNNSGraphMessageLevelWarning | BNNSGraphMessageLevelError)
